 girls soon find their new lives are worse than their old ones.  When Danni discovers what has happened, she must convince Jeremiah to undo the miracle, switching the girls back - and still make Rachel’s wish for a family come true.","duration":6720000,"originalContentDuration":5655000,"allotment":6720,"rating":"PG","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6740eca3091e2400132b6566/screenshot16_9_1765473485891.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Romance","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/6740eca3091e2400132b6566/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6740eca3091e2400132b6566/poster_1765473485891.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6740eca3091e2400132b6566/screenshot4_3_1765473485891.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6740eca3091e2400132b6566/screenshot16_9_1765473485891.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"662671bccee0d900085de8d9"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6740eca3091e2400132b6566/poster16_9_1765473485891.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"clip":{"actors":["Amber Benson","Tygh Runyan"],"directors":["David Weaver"],"originalReleaseDate":"2006-01-01T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"cc":true,"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-service-channel-stitcher-use1-1.prd.pluto.tv/v2/stitch/hls/episode/6740eca3091e2400132b6566/master.m3u8?advertisingId=&appName=web&appVersion=7.9.0-a9cca6b89aea4dc0998b92a51989d2adb9a9025d&app_name=web&clientDeviceType=0&clientID=26edbacb-c8f8-4e35-bb8f-33054c4d7fa3&clientModelNumber=1.0.0&country=CA&deviceDNT=false&deviceId=26edbacb-c8f8-4e35-bb8f-33054c4d7fa3&deviceLat=45.4200&deviceLon=-75.7000&deviceMake=Chrome&deviceModel=web&deviceType=web&deviceVersion=16.2.0&marketingRegion=CA&serverSideAds=true&sess